# Conduit QA — API test automation

![API tests](badge-url)

Playwright + TypeScript test suite for the RealWorld Conduit API.

## Run it
npm ci && npm run test:api

## Design decisions
- Typed API clients return raw responses; tests own assertions.
- Contract validation with zod on every response.
- Worker-scoped user by default, factory fixtures for fresh users.
- All test data created per test with faker + unique ids; seeds logged for replay.
- Cleanup in fixture teardown; parallel-safe by design.
- Data-driven validation, permission-matrix and edge-case tests.

## Findings
Bugs and spec deviations found, with links to the tests that show them.

## Not covered, and why
Load testing (see perf/, run locally only), contract testing (single consumer).